From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nekokabu <nekokabu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:55:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 9999] harness: headless verification harness and core instrumentation

Not for upstream: the headless/ runner (frame-limited runs with RAM watches, input
scripts, RAM dumps, RDP list dumps), the T_* environment knobs for every timing
constant, the ARES_*_LOG traces (incl. the BYTES RDRAM-traffic line), and the experimental models (RDP edge walker,
per-triangle costs, Z coverage estimator) used to verify series v26 against the
console measurements. Apply after 0032 with `git apply`.

---
